<title>GERMANY: Bayer Q2 97 pre-tax profit up 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Bayer Q2 97 pre-tax profit up 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LEVERKUSEN, Germany 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,570   vs 1,560</p>
<p>    Group sales				  14,246  vs 12,621</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>     Domestic companies			4,701   vs 4,335</p>
<p>     Foreign companies			 9,545   vs 8,286</p>
<p>    Personnel expenses			 7,770   vs 7,409</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    750     vs 775</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 4,735   vs 4,414</p>
<p>    Parent personnel expenses		2,673   vs 3,086</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemical group is Bayer AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
